msgid ""
"Tip: open Glimpse instantly with a gesture.\n"
"\n"
"Set one under Settings → Taps and gestures → Gesture manager → pick a gesture → Reader → 'Open Glimpse'.\n"
"\n"
"(This tip is shown only once.)"
msgstr ""
"Maslahat: Glimpse'ni imo-ishora bilan darhol oching.\n"
"\n"
"Bittasini o'rnating: Sozlamalar → Teginish va imo-ishoralar → Imo-ishora menejeri → imo-ishorani tanlang → O'quvchi → 'Glimpse'ni ochish'.\n"
"\n"
"(Bu maslahat faqat bir marta ko'rsatiladi.)"

msgid "Mode: Show all images"
msgstr "Rejim: Barcha rasmlarni ko'rsatish"

