msgstr "Rejim: Joriy bobgacha rasmlarni ko'rsatish"

msgid "Show images up to current chapter"
msgstr "Joriy bobgacha rasmlarni ko'rsatish"

msgid ""
"Images that appear beyond your current position stay hidden, so you can't "
"spoil yourself. Granularity is per chapter: images in the chapter you are "
"currently reading are shown."
msgstr ""
"Joriy holatingizdan nariga chiqadigan rasmlar yashirin qoladi, shunda "
"o'zingizga spoyler qilmaysiz. Granulyarlik bob bo'yicha: hozir o'qiyotgan "
"bobingizdagi rasmlar ko'rsatiladi."

msgid "Show all images"
msgstr "Barcha rasmlarni ko'rsatish"

msgid ""
"Show reference images from anywhere in the book, including parts you haven't"
" reached yet."
msgstr ""
"Kitobning istalgan joyidan, siz hali yetib bormagan qismlar ham, ma'lumot "
"rasmlarini ko'rsatish."

